# Per-seed training logs from scripts/seed_sweep.py. They exist so a sweep in
# flight can be followed with `tail -f` -- a twenty-minute job with no visible
# progress is indistinguishable from a hung one. The results are the committed
# .md and .json reports beside them; a progress log is not evidence.
reports/sweeps/*.log
